<title>USA: Riggs unit sells $200 mln trust preferred.</title>
<headline>Riggs unit sells $200 mln trust preferred.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of trust preferred securities from Riggs Capital II was priced in the 144A private placment market on Friday, said manager Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Riggs Capital II is a unit of Riggs National Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER RIGGS CAPITAL II</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	  COUPON 8.875 PCT   MATURITY 3/15/27</p>
<p>TYPE TRUST PFD SECS ISS PRICE 100.00   FIRST PAY DATE 9/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S baa3   SPREAD 194.5 BP    FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS			    CALLABLE NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>NOTE: Priced over the old 30-year U.S. Treasury bond.</p>
<p>((-- U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
